    tags: ["radio-training-schools", "gmdss", "fees"],
    cross_references: ["mc-10-07-98"],
    fullText: "MEMORANDUM CIRCULAR\nNO. 16-08-99\n\nSUBJECT:     AMENDMENTS TO MEMORANDUM CIRCULAR NO. 10-07-98 RE:\n             ADDITIONAL GUIDELINES IN IMPLEMENTATION OF STCW-95\n             CONCERNING RADIO TRAINING SCHOOLS OFFERING GMDSS\n             RADIOCOMMUNICATION COURSE.\n\n      Further to the provisions of Memorandum Circular No. 10-7-98 Commission hereby\namend said circular to include an additional Section of Schedule of Fees as follows:\n\n      5.0.   Schedule Fees\n\n             5.1    The following shall be charged by the Commission.\n\n                    5.1.1    Filing Fee for Certificate Recognition        P 150.00\n\n                    5.1.2    Certificate of Recognition per year Fee         900.00\n\n                    5.1.3    Application Fee for Radio Station License       150.00\n\n                    5.1.4    Radio Station License per year Fee              300.00\n\n                    5.1.5    Construction Permit Fee                         400.00\n\n                    5.1.6    Annual Inspection Fee                           400.00\n\n       This amendment takes effect immediately and all other provisions in Memorandum\nCircular No. 10-7-98 stands.\n\n      Quezon City, Philippines, 27 August 1999.\n\n                              (SGD.) JOSEPH A. SANTIAGO\n                                      Commissioner\n\n(SGD.) AURELIO M. UMALI                                    (SGD.) NESTOR C. DACANAY\n   Deputy Commissioner                                           Deputy Commissioner\n\n                                               1",
    sections: [
      { heading: "Fee Schedule", body: "Sets fees at: P150 filing fee for Certificate Recognition, P900 annual Certificate of Recognition fee, P150 application fee for Radio Station License, P300 annual Radio Station License fee, P400 Construction Permit fee, and P400 Annual Inspection fee. All other provisions of MC 10-7-98 remain in force, effective immediately." }
    ]
