    fullText: "MEMORANDUM CIRCULAR\nNO. 10-06-99\n\nSUBJECT:       AMENDING SECTION E-1 OF MEMORANDUM CIRCULAR NO. 7-6-98.\n\nPursuant to Act No. 3846, as amended and other applicable laws, Section E No. 1 of\nMemorandum Circular No. 7-6-98 is hereby amended as follows:\n\nA one time special permit fee of Three hundred pesos (PHP 300.00) per SRRS unit shall be\ncollected from NTC authorized dealers upon application in accordance with Section D-1.\n\nAll other provisions shall remain in force.\n\nThis Circular shall take effect fifteen (15) days after publication and may be revised, revoked or\namended, in the interest of public service and as determined by the Commission.\n\nAny circular, order or memorandum, which is inconsistent herewith, is deemed superseded.\n\nQuezon City, Philippines, June 01,1999.\n\n                                (SGD.) JOSEPH A. SANTIAGO\n                                        Commissioner\n\n(SGD.) NESTOR C. DACANAY                                      (SGD.) AURELIO M. UMALI\n   Deputy Commissioner                                            Deputy Commissioner\n\n                                                1",
