    tags: ["satellite-communications", "tvro", "registration"],
    cross_references: ["mc-10-7-93"],
    fullText: "08 February 1994\n\nNTC\nMEMORANDUM CIRCULAR\nNO. 5-2-94\n\nSUBJECT:      REGISTRATION AND LICENSING OF ALL TELEVISION\n              RECEIVE ONLY (TVRO) STATION\n\n       Pursuant to Department Circular No. 93-273 as implemented under NTC\nMemorandum Circular No. 10-07-93, all Non-Commercial and Commercial Television\nReceive Only (TVRO) stations must be registered and/or licensed, respectively, with this\nCommission (Central Office) or any of its Regional Offices within sixty (60) days from\ndate hereof.\n\n       Failure to register and license any TVRO station shall be subject to administrative\nsanctions by the Commission.\n\n                                     (SGD.) SIMEON L. KINTANAR\n                                              Commissioner\n\nCDS/BGP\n     TVRORGTN.MEM\n     Diskette: Project",
    sections: [
      { heading: "Registration Requirement and Deadline", body: "All Non-Commercial and Commercial TVRO stations must be registered and/or licensed, respectively, with the Commission's Central Office or Regional Offices within 60 days of this Circular's issuance. Failure to register or license a TVRO station subjects the operator to administrative sanctions." }
    ]
