    fullText: "MEMORANDUM CIRCULAR\nNO. 12-12-93\n\nSubject:   ALLOCATION OF FREQUENCY BAND 75.225 – 75.425 MHz\n           FOR LOW POWER RF SYSTEM\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------\n-\n\nPursuant to Act No. 3846 as amended, the existing local and\ninternational radio laws and in order to address the\nrequirements of Low Power RF System with a limited power of\n50 milliwatt or less and an emission of F3 (FM), the\nfrequency band of 75.225 – 75.425 Mhz is hereby allocated\nfor the said service.\n\nThis circular shall      take effect immediately and it\nsupersedes any other     circulars which are inconsistent\nherewith.\n\nDone   this  3rd   day   of   December   1993,   Quezon   City,\nPhilippines.\n\n(SGD.) SIMEON L. KINTANAR\nCommissioner",
    sections: [
      { heading: "Allocated Band and Limits", body: "Allocates 75.225-75.425 MHz for Low Power RF Systems limited to 50 milliwatts or less power with F3 (FM) emission. Effective immediately, superseding inconsistent prior circulars." }
    ]
